-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GeoTag commercial authorization
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Official builds gate paid capabilities behind a license token signed by GeoTag:

  - eink              e-ink screen push
  - buzz              find-my-asset buzzer
  - notify            outbound alert email / webhook
  - login_copyright   replacing the default login-page copyright line

A token may also cap beacon/gateway counts and set an expiry date.
Each token is bound to one server install ID. The Ed25519 signing private
key is not in this repository (see deploy/.license-private* in .gitignore).

Compiling from this source and changing or removing the check is permitted
under AGPL. That does not grant a commercial license from GeoTag, and it
does not authorize using GeoTag branding as your own.

中文：本仓库按 AGPL-3.0-or-later 开源。官方包用授权码解锁「墨水屏改屏」
「蜂鸣寻找」「告警通知」「登录页版权」；私钥不公开。自行改源码绕过校验
不等于获得商业授权。
